Package: scmarkeragent
Title: Evidence-Grounded Cell-Type Annotation for Seurat Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Haoran", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chenhaoran@stu.njmu.edu.cn"),
    person("Chen", "Cao", role = "aut", email = "caochen@njmu.edu.cn"))
Description: Annotates single-cell RNA-seq clusters by measuring curated marker
    panels in the data and letting a language model decide which identity those
    measurements support, with every claim resolving to a publication and its
    source sentence. Reads Seurat .rds objects natively and runs from raw counts,
    against one shared configuration, one set of prompts and one marker resource.
